sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Hannezo et al. (2011) PRL & Shyer et al. (2013) Science sequential smooth-muscle mucosal buckling into ridges, zigzags, and hexagonal villi — MorphoEval overall 52.8/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py` (overall weighted score: 55.8/100). The v1 script implements the Hannezo-Shyer mucosal bending rigidity B_e = E_e*h_e^3/(12*(1-nu^2)), mesenchymal foundation stiffness K_s = E_s/H_s, and quartic buckling wavelength scaling lambda_* ~ (B_e/K_s)^(1/4) across Chick E6-E16, but relies on a closed-form 2D Fourier ansatz instead of minimizing the Föppl-von Kármán / neo-Hookean mucosal energy functional F[w], omits the 12-point 3-species comparative collapse (chick, quail, mouse) and stage-specific FK506 smooth-muscle ablation / surgical slit controls, and does not segment the vendored histology specimen (`intestinal_villi_crypts_specimen.jpg`). Overall 52.8/100 (faithfulness 46.4, reproducibility 67.6); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 57, Morphological realism / specimen match 34, Parameter expressivity 48, Morphometric validation 52, Source and data traceability 74, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus_comparison.png: rendered output of 2013-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling.py at e93f00e, image/png, 164272 B, 1495×1105 px, artifact_sha256 6e9b91bbf80b94a3cc0b4c6533d28c5de4e2a2494a675fb34bc100d61c67e40a (sha256 6e9b91bbf80b94a3cc0b4c6533d28c5de4e2a2494a675fb34bc100d61c67e40a), spec_fingerprint f6a04e7da51440cd41541428ef80cd7b7e9f5332411d929e37970e56635d68c5. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: f6a04e7da51440cd41541428ef80cd7b7e9f5332411d929e37970e56635d68c5; artifact_sha256: 6e9b91bbf80b94a3cc0b4c6533d28c5de4e2a2494a675fb34bc100d61c67e40a; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus/epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus_reference.json=1887bf2160034e33..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus/intestinal_villi_crypts_specimen.jpg=30afcb789bbdc60c..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus/paper_citations.bib=a8bc0251af8be542..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus/scout_manifest.json=1e6e1bbc98fb4873...}." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement Shyer et al. (2013) Figs. 2-4 FK506 smooth-muscle inhibition and surgical muscle-slit rescue controls (FK506 at E6 -> smooth; surgical slit at E10 -> flat; FK506 at E11 -> arrested at ridges; FK506 at E14 -> arrested at zigzags; WT E16 -> hexagonal villi).",
            "remediation needed: Implement the 12-point comparative wavelength scaling collapse across Chick (Gallus gallus), Quail (Coturnix japonica), and Mouse (Mus musculus) with Pearson r, p-value, RMSE, and log-log scaling slope.",
            "remediation needed: Replace the closed-form 2D Fourier ansatz with a 2D pseudo-spectral / L-BFGS-B Föppl-von Kármán + neo-Hookean stromal foundation free-energy minimizer F[w] that relaxes mucosal height w(x,y) across smooth, 1D ridge, 2D herringbone zigzag, and hexagonal villus-crypt regimes.",
            "remediation needed: Segment the vendored CC0 intestinal villi histology micrograph (`intestinal_villi_crypts_specimen.jpg`) to extract villus centroids, Delaunay triangulation coordination number Z, hexagonal bond-orientational order |Psi_6|, and inter-villus spacing CV, and enforce runtime SHA-256 verification." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.528"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 063 Pass 1 Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

